WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.521
Salom!

2
00:00:00.521 --> 00:00:06.952
Bugun ikkinchi va undan yuqori tartibli chiziqli tenglamalarni o‘rganamiz,

3
00:00:06.952 --> 00:00:10.776
ularning koeffitsiyentlari o‘zgarmas sonlar.

4
00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:18.337
Bunday tenglamalar elektr zanjirlarida, prujinalarda va boshqaruv tizimlarida uchraydi.

5
00:00:18.337 --> 00:00:27.114
Darsning oxirida siz har qanday shunday tenglamaning umumiy yechimini bir necha daqiqada yoza olasiz,

6
00:00:27.114 --> 00:00:30.590
faqat bitta algebraik tenglamani yechib.

7
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.134
Asosiy g‘oya juda oddiy.

8
00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:37.530
Yechimni e daraja r iks ko‘rinishida izlaymiz.

9
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:45.845
Har bir hosila faqat r ko‘paytuvchini qo‘shadi: birinchi hosila r marta e daraja r iks,

10
00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.903
ikkinchi hosila r kvadrat marta.

11
00:00:48.903 --> 00:00:57.409
Tenglamaga qo‘yib, noldan farqli eksponentaga qisqartirsak, r ga nisbatan ko‘phad qoladi.

12
00:00:57.409 --> 00:00:59.798
Bu xarakteristik ko‘phad.

13
00:01:00.048 --> 00:01:02.970
Ildizlar uch xil bo‘lishi mumkin.

14
00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:08.281
Har xil haqiqiy ildizlar har biri bitta eksponentani beradi.

15
00:01:08.281 --> 00:01:16.249
Karrali ildiz, masalan ikki karrali, e daraja r iks va iks marta e daraja r iks ni beradi.

16
00:01:16.249 --> 00:01:26.342
Kompleks juftlik alfa plyus minus i beta esa e daraja alfa iks marta kosinus beta iks va sinus beta iks ni beradi.

17
00:01:26.592 --> 00:01:36.293
Misol: y ikki shtrix minus ikki y shtrix plyus besh y teng nol, boshlang‘ich shartlar y nolda bir,

18
00:01:36.293 --> 00:01:38.272
y shtrix nolda besh.

19
00:01:38.272 --> 00:01:44.904
Xarakteristik tenglama: r kvadrat minus ikki r plyus besh teng nol.

20
00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:54.110
Diskriminant manfiy, minus o‘n olti, shuning uchun ildizlar kompleks: bir plyus minus ikki i.

21
00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.821
Demak alfa bir, beta ikki,

22
00:01:56.821 --> 00:02:05.906
umumiy yechim e daraja iks marta qavs ichida C bir kosinus ikki iks plyus C ikki sinus ikki iks.

23
00:02:05.906 --> 00:02:14.992
Iks nolga teng bo‘lganda kosinus bir, sinus nol, shuning uchun birinchi shartdan C bir teng bir.

24
00:02:14.992 --> 00:02:21.806
Ikkinchi shart uchun avval hosilani ko‘paytma qoidasi bilan hisoblaymiz.

25
00:02:22.056 --> 00:02:27.781
Hosilaning nol nuqtadagi qiymati C bir plyus ikki C ikki ga teng.

26
00:02:27.781 --> 00:02:32.538
Bu beshga teng bo‘lishi kerak, demak C ikki teng ikki.

27
00:02:32.538 --> 00:02:39.232
Javob: y teng e daraja iks marta kosinus ikki iks plyus ikki sinus ikki iks.

28
00:02:39.232 --> 00:02:46.190
Tekshirish: tenglamaga qo‘ysak nol chiqadi, boshlang‘ich qiymatlar ham to‘g‘ri.

29
00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:47.933
Grafikka qarang.

30
00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:57.640
Ko‘k chiziq bizning yechim: u tebranadi, lekin amplitudasi e daraja iks kabi o‘sadi, chunki alfa musbat.

31
00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:07.347
Ikkinchi chiziq alfa manfiy bo‘lgan holat, e daraja minus iks marta kosinus ikki iks: tebranish so‘nadi.

32
00:03:07.347 --> 00:03:14.534
Alfa ishorasi o‘sish yoki so‘nishni, beta esa tebranish tezligini belgilaydi.

33
00:03:14.784 --> 00:03:17.369
Endi o‘zingizni sinab ko‘ring.

34
00:03:17.369 --> 00:03:27.970
Ekrandagi savolga javob bering: y ikki shtrix plyus to‘rt y shtrix plyus to‘rt y teng nol tenglamaning yechimlari qaysilar?

35
00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:34.606
Xarakteristik ko‘phadni yozing va uning ildizlarini karraligi bilan aniqlang.

36
00:03:34.606 --> 00:03:37.622
Videoni to‘xtatib, javobni tanlang.
